<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 7.01 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 7.01 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 7.01 percent on Sunday from 6.90 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded in 15 reported transactions worth 23.15 million dinars ($32.6 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
